>> title: Victoria Sponge
>> category: Cakes & Loaves
>> tags: jam, cream, british, oven
>> counters: Bakery
>> aka: Victoria sandwich, Victoria sandwich cake
>> servings: 8
>> time: 1 hr 30 min

Grease two #8-in round cake pans{} and line the bottoms with parchment.

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (180°C).

Beat @unsalted butter{1%cup}(225 g; softened), @caster sugar{1%cup}(225 g) until pale.

Beat @eggs{4%large}, @vanilla extract{1%tsp}(5 mL) into @&(~1)creamed butter{}.

Fold @self-raising flour{1 3/4%cup}(225 g), @whole milk{2%Tbs}(30 mL) into @&(~1)batter{}.

Bake @&(~1)batter{} at 350°F for ~{25%min}, then cool completely.

Whip @heavy cream{2/3%cup}(160 mL), @powdered sugar{1%Tbs}(8 g) to soft peaks.

Sandwich @&(6)cooled cakes{} with @&(~1)whipped cream{}, @raspberry jam{1/2%cup}(150 g).
